==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s (800%) spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (800%) spawn, delay 0.33~2 seconds<sup>10f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.33~2 seconds<sup>10f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**2 [[Gory Groom]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main problem is the Bore shredding your [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] cats, but this is only a problem if you have never faced a Bore before. After killing the Bore, you should be able to destroy the base on 1-{{2c}} difficulties. On {{3c}}, just stall and chip down/kill the Gory Grooms while managing the Bore with [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] cats such as [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]]. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] is good here, as having multiple stacked up can do a really good job at mowing down the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies and damaging the Bore, as well as protecting your stronger units.

